{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20264reXliHqI71793143715.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>納芯微電子截至九月底止季度按年轉虧為盈，賺1,606萬元人民幣，扣除非經常性損益純利1,256萬元人民幣。</p><p></p><p>期內收入增長一倍，至16.85億元人民幣，主要得益於內地需求回暖及光儲和汽車出口加速、AI算力基建需求爆發等多種因素，以及下游汽車電子、服務器電源、光伏與儲能、工業自動化等領域客戶需求快速增長。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T00:21:01.588097+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T23:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T12:18:15.908667+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T00:18:15.419022+00:00","content_hash":"c5498a66d0423d529fa7d6cac3900f6fb9d23dba0b8dbcd128aa202cb1dd2ac5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T00:21:01.588097+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}